00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:21,480
Yeah, and then there's a lot of betting market anomalies

373
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:23,600
that I have noticed, as far as anyone who has studied,

374
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:26,880
just things like people don't like giving odds on bets.

375
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:30,000
Which again, is so if you do try betting people on things

