00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:45,200
To entice a person to go and lose their money.

384
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:46,240
That makes perfect sense.

385
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:48,320
So if you really have inside information,

386
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:50,600
if you really know the odds are five to one,

387
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:54,000
and someone wants you to pay them three to one,

388
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:55,000
that's a great deal.

389
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,920
Because it's, well, sure, sure, three to one's great.

390
00:14:57,920 --> 00:15:00,420
Because I know that actually you only have a one in five chance

391
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:00,920
of winning.

392
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:04,240
So the fact that I have to give you three times, that still

393
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,720
is a great deal for me.

394
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:09,900
So in the same way that you want to entice customers

395
00:15:09,900 --> 00:15:12,980
with good prices, you want to entice betting partners

396
00:15:12,980 --> 00:15:14,400
with good odds.

397
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:16,000
And the only thing you have to be careful about

398
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,720
is that you don't make your prices so good

399
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,680
that you lose money.

400
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:21,000
And you don't want to make your odds so favorable

401
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,720
that you, on average, you lose money.

402
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:24,480
But there should be plenty of room

403
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:27,040
