404
00:15:27,040 --> 00:15:29,840
and even odds to do something in between.

405
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:32,200
And yet it's very hard to get people to give odds.

406
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:34,000
So the obvious explanation, of course,

